WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.758 --> 00:00:08.733
This is a short tour of the Crewflow web console, using fictional demonstration

2
00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:09.111
data.

3
00:00:09.565 --> 00:00:16.735
The Dashboard summarises your staff, offers, shifts and attendance. Every card links

4
00:00:16.735 --> 00:00:18.613
to the page behind it.

5
00:00:19.074 --> 00:00:25.616
The sidebar is grouped. The main pages are at the top, Operations holds Calendar,

6
00:00:25.616 --> 00:00:32.401
Venues and Venue Offers, and Workspace holds the Audit Log, Help Center and Support.

7
00:00:32.854 --> 00:00:38.253
Users lists your staff, and the venue managers who work at your venues.

8
00:00:38.709 --> 00:00:44.678
Shifts shows every shift, how many places are filled, and its status.

9
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:50.454
Offers tracks each offer you have sent, and how staff have responded.

10
00:00:50.911 --> 00:00:57.210
Venue Offers lists staffing requests and shifts, each with its own staffing board.

11
00:00:57.668 --> 00:01:03.502
The calendar shows the month ahead. Select a day to see its shifts.

12
00:01:03.967 --> 00:01:10.491
Press the forward slash key at any time to search people, venues, shifts and offers.

13
00:01:10.946 --> 00:01:15.055
And Help Center has short guides to everyday tasks.
